('COMPDB','Clang JSON compilation database','https://clang.llvm.org/docs/JSONCompilationDatabase.html','T07','Format, lines 169-198; Background generated-source prerequisites','Only format and background inspected; stale Supported Systems text is not used as current availability evidence.'),
